title: moon5_obsidian_intro
---
Milo: The Obsidian Moon. The Crystal Palace.
Milo: This is where the 1893 World's Fair really happened. The diaries were buried under volcanic glass when the architects vanished.
Milo: Find the diaries. They were writing about us before we were born.
===

title: moon5_diary_excerpt
---
[Diary fragment, dated 1893]
"The frequencies the giants used are mathematically predictable. We have transcribed them.
If our descendants find this — sing 7-83 hertz, 432 hertz, 528 hertz, in that order.
The Earth itself will respond. We know this because we have heard her respond."
===

title: moon6_aqua_sunken_intro
---
Milo: The Aqua Sunken Moon. An entire Tartarian cathedral is under the water here.
Milo: Lirael remembers swimming through it as a girl. *(softly)* When she was alive.
Milo: We must drain it. Or sing to the water until it parts. Old methods.
===

title: moon7_frost_vault_intro
---
Korath_Echo: *(from deep within ice)*
Korath_Echo: TRAVELER. You came.
Korath_Echo: I am in this vault. Frozen. Listening.
Korath_Echo: The Parasite Cabal kept me here as a captive resonator. Sing the unlocking note and I am free.
===

title: moon8_aether_airship_intro
---
Milo: The sky cathedral. The first time we will fly.
Milo: The Tartarians built airships on the principle of frequency-cancellation. The hull *unhears* gravity.
Milo: With Korath's gift, you can pilot one. The fleet is yours to command, in time.
===

title: moon9_cinder_solar_intro
---
Milo: The Cinder Moon. The Sun-Fort.
Milo: This is where the Parasite Cabal made their stand the first time. They burned this whole region to mask their retreat.
Milo: Find the predictive letters. The architects predicted *this exact battle*. Word for word.
===

title: moon10_verdant_grove_intro
---
Milo: The Verdant Moon. The Orphan Terminus.
Milo: All the rails you restored on the Electric Moon — they all lead here.
Milo: The children's final station. Where the song was supposed to bloom into a forest.
Milo: It almost did. We can finish it.
===

title: moon11_mist_fountain_intro
---
Milo: The Mist Moon. The Purification Fountain.
Milo: This is the inverse of Echohaven. Where you started by waking, here you wake by *unwaking*.
Milo: Cleanse every Aether band. Bring them to silence. From silence comes the truest song.
===

title: moon12_mirror_bell_intro
---
Korath_In_Bell: *(echo inside the bell)*
Korath_In_Bell: You came.
Korath_In_Bell: Strike me three times. Three by six by nine.
Korath_In_Bell: The mirror behind the bell will show every restored building in every Moon — all at once.
Korath_In_Bell: That will be the moment you remember why you started.
===

title: moon13_cosmic_harmony_convergence
---
Lirael: *(no longer translucent — fully present)*
Lirael: We did it.
Lirael: All thirteen Moons sing together. Day Out of Time has come.
Lirael: The Parasite Cabal cannot lie inside this harmony. They cannot lie when the world itself is singing the truth.
Lirael: Listen, traveler. Listen to what we built.
===

title: moon13_milo_final_speech
---
Milo: *(quietly)*
Milo: The empire never fell. It was only buried.
Milo: The song never stopped. It was only waiting for someone to remember how to listen.
Milo: That someone was you, traveler.
Milo: That someone was us.
===
